@startuml MatchdayNewsNavigation
title Navegación interna - Noticias

left to right direction
skinparam linetype ortho

rectangle "Listado\n/news" as List
rectangle "Detalle\n/news/:id" as Detail
rectangle "Administración\n/news/manage" as Manage

List --> Detail : leer noticia
List --> Manage : administrar
Detail --> List : volver
Manage --> Detail : abrir publicada
Manage --> List : volver

note bottom of Manage
  Borrador -> programada o publicada.
  Solo las publicadas aparecen en el listado.
end note
@enduml
